sag2_v10_oracle.json and sag2_v10_dpp.json in this directory are unmodified
copies of tests/sag2_v10_oracle.json and tests/sag2_v10_dpp.json from SAG-Wiki
(https://github.com/Zleap-AI/SAG-Wiki), commit 61f63c6, including their recorded
